{"timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:23:02.380Z","ordinal":92,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1d9fc-8ce9-7420-953c-6c7a3fab8a59","turn_id":"01a1d9fc-8cfb-7500-aadc-dd421289bedc","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_68e6a50ae417ee20faaf9c46","summary_text":[],"raw_content":["The environment lacks cargo/rustc (`which cargo rustc` returned nothing). The unblob package itself requires building a Rust extension (maturin). taplo also needs maturin+rust. Without Rust toolchain, `uv sync` fails. Options:\n\n- `uv sync` might work if we can install rust... AGENTS.md says don't install tools with system package managers; the nix dev shell provides Rust but direnv isn't available. Check if nix exists: `ls /nix`, `which nix`.\n\nLet me check whether there's a way to get the venv working: maybe `uv sync --no-dev`? But unblob itself needs maturin build (rust). Check if there's a prebuilt wheel or if `_rust` is already compiled somewhere. Check `python/unblob/_rust/`."]},"started_at_ms":1794658982378,"completed_at_ms":1794658982380}}
