{"timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:24:43.567Z","ordinal":109,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1d9fc-8ce9-7420-953c-6c7a3fab8a59","turn_id":"01a1d9fc-8cfb-7500-aadc-dd421289bedc","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_4a919d3f3bf3b2e42b765036","summary_text":[],"raw_content":["The build fails on taplo (needs Rust via maturin, and rustup fails due to HOME mismatch). The error earlier: \"$HOME differs from euid-obtained home directory: you may be using sudo\". We're running as... HOME=/home/dev/.codex-relay-home-xnc2ii__ but euid home is /home/dev. Workaround: set HOME=/home/dev when running uv? Or set RUSTUP_HOME/CARGO_HOME. Actually puccinialin (maturin's rust installer) installs rustup into ~/.cache/puccinialin. The rustup script complains about HOME mismatch. If I run with HOME=/home/dev, rustup would work, and uv cache would be at /home/dev/.cache — fine.\n\nBut wait — do we even have network? uv downloaded packages earlier (it got to building taplo), so yes network works.\n\nAlso unblob itself needs maturin to build the rust extension — that needs cargo too. puccinialin will install rust for that as well, presumably.\n\nLet me try: `HOME=/home/dev uv sync --all-extras --dev`. This may take a while (rust install + builds)."]},"started_at_ms":1794659083565,"completed_at_ms":1794659083567}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:24:43.570Z","ordinal":110,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_4a919d3f3bf3b2e42b765036","summary":[],"content":[{"type":"reasoning_text","text":"The build fails on taplo (needs Rust via maturin, and rustup fails due to HOME mismatch). The error earlier: \"$HOME differs from euid-obtained home directory: you may be using sudo\". We're running as... HOME=/home/dev/.codex-relay-home-xnc2ii__ but euid home is /home/dev. Workaround: set HOME=/home/dev when running uv? Or set RUSTUP_HOME/CARGO_HOME. Actually puccinialin (maturin's rust installer) installs rustup into ~/.cache/puccinialin. The rustup script complains about HOME mismatch. If I run with HOME=/home/dev, rustup would work, and uv cache would be at /home/dev/.cache — fine.\n\nBut wait — do we even have network? uv downloaded packages earlier (it got to building taplo), so yes network works.\n\nAlso unblob itself needs maturin to build the rust extension — that needs cargo too. puccinialin will install rust for that as well, presumably.\n\nLet me try: `HOME=/home/dev uv sync --all-extras --dev`. This may take a while (rust install + builds)."}],"encrypted_content":null,"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1d9fc-8cfb-7500-aadc-dd421289bedc"}}}
