{"timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:54:49.409Z","ordinal":508,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1d9fc-8ce9-7420-953c-6c7a3fab8a59","turn_id":"01a1d9fc-8cfb-7500-aadc-dd421289bedc","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_0d56604da6257d50cea348cb","summary_text":[],"raw_content":["ubireader's `extract_blocks` fails on the bad PEB: it finds \"UBI#\" magic (our bad PEB has UBI# magic with broken CRC), tries to parse the VID header at vid_hdr_offset... our bad PEB has 0xEE garbage at vid offset → vid_hdr parse returns None? → AttributeError. So ubireader crashes on our bad PEB because the EC magic is present (it doesn't check EC CRC apparently, or checks but continues).\n\nLet me look at extract_blocks to understand what it tolerates."]},"started_at_ms":1794660889408,"completed_at_ms":1794660889409}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:54:49.412Z","ordinal":509,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0d56604da6257d50cea348cb","summary":[],"content":[{"type":"reasoning_text","text":"ubireader's `extract_blocks` fails on the bad PEB: it finds \"UBI#\" magic (our bad PEB has UBI# magic with broken CRC), tries to parse the VID header at vid_hdr_offset... our bad PEB has 0xEE garbage at vid offset → vid_hdr parse returns None? → AttributeError. So ubireader crashes on our bad PEB because the EC magic is present (it doesn't check EC CRC apparently, or checks but continues).\n\nLet me look at extract_blocks to understand what it tolerates."}],"encrypted_content":null,"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1d9fc-8cfb-7500-aadc-dd421289bedc"}}}
